5. WHAT THE PROGRAM IS NOT. CehoProxy provides no network access and ships
   with no subscriptions. It is a routing tool: it directs the traffic of the
   programs you select into a tunnel you specify yourself. Choosing that tunnel
   provider and complying with applicable law is the user's responsibility.

6. NO WARRANTY. The program is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
   To the extent permitted by applicable law, the copyright holder is not
